{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128161011576-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128161011\"/><p>旺角有人暈倒後死亡。今晨(28日)11時14分，一名50歲男子被發現在大南街64號的住所暈倒，由家人報案。救援人員抵達現場，證實事主已經死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。案件列作「屍體發現」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:35:56.453438+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:10:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:40.947354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:33.011214+00:00","content_hash":"e0cc50a319d8f850489355f598ab4116ac767c30b066c12f034db6e6b1f462cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:35:56.453438+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}